{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11307150","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11307150","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1130715001:1":{"text":"去和朋友们玩了，他们那么久没见，先是大吵一架，过几分钟就又和好了。哈，小孩子。","source_cn":"去和朋友们玩了，他们那么久没见，先是大吵一架，过几分钟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8051715081E915F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130715002:1":{"text":"我始终没有告诉女儿真相，那些孩子们年纪小，也没明白之前到底发生了什么。","source_cn":"我始终没有告诉女儿真相，那些孩子们年纪小，也没明白之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A2D3764E92C16FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130715003:1":{"text":"这样也好，或许再过几年，他们就会把这段糟糕的经历忘了吧。","source_cn":"这样也好，或许再过几年，他们就会把这段糟糕的经历忘了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50CC98F8DCCCB1EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:部落成员登利":{"text":"部落成员登利","source":"部落成员登利","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}